UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_140611a20 SET addr=5375547936, role='MATCH state machine (dispatch on G+1). Case 0 = match init: zero blk+0x3d38..0x3db8 and the battle block, G+0x85=G+0x18, G+0x83=G+0x4f (CPU level), G+0x4e=6, G+0xb2=3, and if (config+0x828 != 0) G+0xa6 = 1 (0x140611c1f-0x140611c2e) = the TRAINING flag. Case 8: if G+0x4c==7 G+0x2c=2.';
UPSERT steam_routine:LAB_14060be10 SET addr=5375524368, role='caseD_3 scene-entry label (not a Ghidra function; body 0x14060be10-0x14060bf30): the Steam replacement for the DC mode menu writing GameGlobal. G+0x14=0x40, G+0=1, G+1=0, G+2=0, then if config+0x828 != 0 {G+0x4c=0, G+0x4a=1, G+0x44=0, G+0x4d=3 (infinite clock), FUN_140610870(3)} else if config+0x7c0 != 0 {G+0x4c=0, G+0x4a=1, G+0x44=0, G+0x2a=1 (versus), FUN_140610870(3)} else if config+0x7f8 != 0 {G+0x4c=0, G+0x4a=1, G+0x44=0, G+0x2a=0, FUN_140610870((config+0x4f0 != 0)+1)} else if blk2[0] > 0 {G+0x4c=0, FUN_140610870(blk2[1])}.';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_140610870 SET addr=5375543408, role='Mode entry: G+0x18 = G+0x85 = (G+0x2a ? 3 : param) human mask, G+0x14=0x60, memset+init six fighter structs (FUN_14062f3f0), blk+0x4400=1 if mask bit0, blk+0x4b38=1 if bit1, G+0=2, G+1..0xf=0, FUN_140609e80.';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_140626fe0 SET addr=5375299552, role='ROUND CLOCK tick (battle block param): +0x61 frame counter; when it reaches 0: if (G+0x4d != 3 && 0 < +0x60) +0x60-- (round seconds; sound at 10/20), +0xa7 = +0x61 = DAT_140a6fa74[G+0x46]. G+0x4d == 3 -> the clock NEVER decrements = training infinite time. On +0x60 == 0 decides the time-over winner by summed health (blk+0x4330/0x51a0/0x6010 vs 0x4a68/0x58d8/0x6748).';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_1406274f0 SET addr=5375300848, role='Round block init: zero battle+0..0xb8, speed triple 0/1/0, stage byte, battle+0xa6 = battle+0x60 = DAT_140a6fa70[G+0x4d] (round seconds: 30/60/99/99), battle+0xa7 = battle+0x61 = DAT_140a6fa74[G+0x46], point-fighter pointer table battle+0x20/+0x38.';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_14063cbc0 SET addr=5375384512, role='Damage apply A: if health (fighter+0x578) <= 0: if G+0xa6 == 0 -> KO (fighter+0x28c=0xff, FUN_1406394b0 death) else health = 1 and red (+0x57c) >= 1 (training health floor). Then FUN_140639200 (attack data export / regen arm).';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_140639d00 SET addr=5375372544, role='Damage apply B (chip/throw path): same health floor under G+0xa6 (health=1, red>=1) instead of FUN_1406394b0.';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_14063afd0 SET addr=5375377360, role='Hit resolution: computes damage via FUN_14063cd30, applies to +0x578/+0x57c; under G+0xa6 the KO path is skipped and health floors at 1. Also handles dizzy meter fighter+0x291 and stun tables.';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_14063cf60 SET addr=5375385440, role='Direct health subtract (param_2): +0x57c red drain by 3x, +0x578 -= dmg; if < 0 -> 0, and under G+0xa6 -> health = 1, red >= 1.';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_140639200 SET addr=5375369728, role='Post-damage bookkeeping: if G+0xa6 -> fighter+0x472 = 0x32 (50 frame regen delay); if config+0x828 && dmg > 0 -> export to host: config+0x914/0x918 total damage, +0x8d4/0x8d8 last damage, +0x944/0x948 combo, +0x974/0x978 valid flags, +0x964/0x968 = 0x1e HUD countdown (per side); achievement bits config+0x548/0x544.';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_14063b920 SET addr=5375379744, role='Per-frame regen (battle state 4, battle+6 == 0): if G+0xa6, for side k in 0..1: if config+0x878+k*4 != 0 and the point fighter is active with +0x472 != 0: +0x472--; at 0 -> health +2 and red +2, capped 0x90 (144), +0x472 = 1. Also the G+0x54 poison drain loop (+0x53b timer, -1 hp to a floor of 1).';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_140634920 SET addr=5375351072, role='Per-frame input mirror + training/online seat controller: copies seat words blk+0x3c66/0x3c7a into fighter input histories (blk+0x4420.., 0x4b58.., 0x5290.., 0x59c8.., 0x6100.., 0x6838..); if (config+0x828 != 0 && config+0x520 != 0) FUN_140634600() [training dummy controller]; if (config+0x80c && config+0x520) the online/versus CPU-seat assignment from config+0x814/+0x818.';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_140634600 SET addr=5375350272, role='TRAINING DUMMY CONTROLLER (per frame, both sides k=0,1; point fighter battle+0x20+k*0x18): HUD countdown config+0x964+k*4 decrement; if config+0x880+k*4 != 0 and point fighter active and not state 0x1d -> FUN_14063bd30(fighter,4) (super meter +4 per frame = infinite gauge); if config+0x888+k*4 != 0 -> fighter+0x291 = 0x50 (dizzy meter pinned); export config+0x984/0x994 = fighter+0x291/+0x292 per side; CPU flags: fighter+0x6b1 = 1 on all three fighters of side k iff ((config+0x850 == 6 && k == dummy side (k == (config+0x82c == 0))) || config+0x850 == 7) && config+0x838 == 0, else 0; RECORD (config+0x850 == 3, dummy side, config+0x520 && config+0x830 == 2 && config+0x838 == 0): config+0xcb0[config+0xca8++] = fighter+0x668 input word (mirrored for facing), max 0xe10 = 3600 frames; PLAYBACK (config+0x850 == 4): fighter+0x668 = config+0xcb0[config+0xcac++], wraps at config+0xca8.';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_140634bc0 SET addr=5375351744, role='is_training_dummy(fighter) = (config+0x828 != 0) && (config+0x82c != (fighter+0x6b0 & 1)) && (config+0x850 < 3). The dummy side is the side that is NOT the local player index config+0x82c.';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_14063a4a0 SET addr=5375374496, role='Per-fighter hit intake: for the training dummy (FUN_140634bc0): config+0x858 == 2 (or 3 -> random bit1) and FUN_140638f80 says guardable -> FUN_140639c80 + FUN_14063b330 = auto guard; config+0x858 == 1 -> fighter+0x29f = 0x3f after a hit. Otherwise normal hit / KO handling.';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_140637f00 SET addr=5375365888, role='Knockdown / tech state machine (fighter+7 substate): case 3: for the dummy, config+0x85c = tech option: 1 = always tech (random direction bits 0x400/0x800 into +0x492, button 0x20/0x100 into +0x496), 2 = random (rand&1), else never; CPU fighters use FUN_1406629c0 instead.';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_14074c080 SET addr=5376532608, role='Air recovery decision: for the dummy config+0x860: 1 = always (fighter+0x2f6 = 0xff, +0x22f = random direction), 2 = random, else 0; humans decide from input bits +0x4aa.';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_14074bbd0 SET addr=5376531408, role='Ground recovery (quick get-up) decision in states 0x12/0x13: for the dummy config+0x868: 1 -> fighter+0x28d = 0 (recover), 2 = random, else -1 (stay down); humans from +0x490 bits 0x300.';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_14063bd30 SET addr=5375380784, role='Meter add guard: skips if the fighter is in certain hyper states (+0x56c & 0x480 or +0x570 & 0x2020000) else FUN_14063bd70(fighter, amount).';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_14063bd70 SET addr=5375380848, role='Super meter add: doubled when G+0x52; adds to *(fighter+0x558) (meter), rolls over at 0x90 into *(fighter+0x560) (level, max 5), sound FUN_1406095f0(fighter,0x45) on level up.';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_14061f030 SET addr=5375262768, role='Per-frame fighter update driver; tail: if (G+0xaa != 0 && battle+6 == 0) FUN_14063bd30(P1 point,4) and FUN_14063bd30(P2 point,4) = the DC training infinite-gauge option (G+0xaa has NO writer on Steam; the host path is config+0x880/0x884 via FUN_140634600).';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_140628320 SET addr=5375304480, role='Battle state dispatch PTR_FUN_140a6fa10[battle+0] then FUN_140627c50 (HUD text); tail: if (G+0xa6 && battle+0 == 4 && G+0xae) { if (DAT_142edf2d1 & 1) FUN_1406281a0(1); if (& 2) FUN_1406281a0(0) } = DC damage display (unused on Steam: G+0xae and 0x142edf2d1 have no writers).';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_1406281a0 SET addr=5375304096, role='Damage display text: DAMAGE (fighter+0x476), TOTAL DAMAGE (+0x330 - +0x344), MAX COMBO (battle+0x98+side*2) via FUN_14060b8c0. Strings 0x14097e874/0x14097e880/0x14097e890.';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_140613cd0 SET addr=5375556816, role='HITBOX DISPLAY: if (config+0x520 != 0 && config+0x8c8 == 0) walk the object lists blk+0x2eee8.. and draw attack/push/hurt boxes with FUN_1406138e0 and cross-hairs with FUN_14084b520 (colors DAT_142eee550). Anchors have config+0x8c8 = 1 (off).';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_140607da0 SET addr=5375508896, role='TRAINING RESET entry (= config+0x28 function pointer, called by host FUN_14004f5b0 when config+8 == 5): if config+0x828 != 0: FUN_14060efd0() (full round re-init) then if config+0x838 >= 2: corner placement: 2 -> local fighter x = -1191.0 (0xc494e000), dummy x = -1245.0, facing +0x174 0/1, camera floats blk+0x6a24/0x6a18/0x69b4/0x695c/0x6914 = -960.0; 3 -> mirrored (+1191/+1245/+960). Local vs dummy fighter chosen by config+0x82c (battle+0x20 vs +0x38).';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_14060efd0 SET addr=5375512528, role='Round re-init used by the training reset: G+4=1, G+0x19=1, G+0x90=0, FUN_1406274f0 (round block, clock), FUN_14061e170, FUN_1406233b0, FUN_140621960, FUN_1406146d0(fighter_i, 0) x6 (fighter reset), FUN_14061c6e0, FUN_14061ca70, FUN_140610710, FUN_1406104d0, FUN_140620200, FUN_140620670, battle+0x65 = 99, then two battle-scene steps.';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_140037370 SET addr=5368804208, role='HOST scene-load settings apply (calls FUN_140037b50): config+0x4f0 = local player idx; config+0x850..0x870 = training dummy settings read from the session settings block DAT_140acd3a8+0xd04b0 via FUN_14003fed0/ff30/ff90/ff70/ff50/fef0/ff10/ffb0; per-side: config+0x878/0x87c (HP regen), 0x880/0x884 (meter), 0x888/0x88c (dizzy pin), 0x890/0x894, 0x898/0x89c, 0x8a0/0x8a4, 0x8a8../0x8b4.. (3 each); 0x8c0/0x8c4/0x8c8 (hitbox off)/0x84c/0x8cc/0x8d0 from *(session+0xd04b8)+0x50/0x54/0x18c/0x190/0x58/0x5c; config+0xca8 = recorded length, 0xcac = 0, FUN_140040a30 fills config+0xcb0 recording; if config+0x850 in {3,4,6,7} -> 0 (record/playback/CPU are not persisted).';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_1400388f0 SET addr=5368809712, role='HOST per-frame in battle: training reset handling when config+0x828 && config+0x780 == 0: config+0x830 == 1 arms (0x834 countdown) -> 0x830 = 2; when 0x830 & 0xf == 2: if 0x830 bit7 -> 0x838 = 1; else if 0x83c lockout expired and config+0x520 and FUN_14004b720(local pad) chord: FUN_140056a30 bits -> 0x838 = 2 (bit7) or 3 (bit 0x20); then if 0x838 != 0: FUN_14004f5b0 (-> config+0x28 = FUN_140607da0), restart record (0xca8 = 0 if 0x850 == 3) or playback (0xcac = 0 if 0x850 == 4), 0x830 = 2, 0x838 = 0, 0x83c = 0x1e.';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_14004f5b0 SET addr=5368710576, role='HOST reset dispatcher: if config+8 != 5 (not battle scene) -> reload scene via config+0x18; else (**(config+0x28))() = FUN_140607da0 and FUN_14006c9b0(DAT_142ebc010,-1).';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_140038430 SET addr=5368808496, role='HOST scene object loader: allocates the three training UI objects (atklog2 FUN_140075290/FUN_140075260, keylog FUN_14008c9a0/FUN_14008c970, keyrecorder FUN_14008d280/FUN_14008d250 -> ui/1_menu/19_training/*) iff config+0x828 != 0; if config+0x794 == 3 -> config+0x52c = session+0xd0454.';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_140627c50 SET addr=5375302736, role='HUD win/score text (WINS %2d 0x14097e838, NEW HERO 0x14097e868, %02d:%02d:%02d 0x14097e858 when G+0x4c == 7): returns early if G+0x4c == 2 (DC training byte, dead on Steam). == SH4 loc_8c046ddc (Text Displays, Training Mode Check at loc_8c046e0c).';
UPSERT steam_routine:FUN_14063cd30 SET addr=5375384880, role='Damage calculation: base from attack table, level table DAT_140a98190, scaled by DAT_140a97e3c[G+0x1b] (damage level 0..3 = 16/32/48/64 over 32) and DAT_140a97fc8[fighter+0x6d7]; CPU scaling DAT_140a980c0/0e0[battle+0x69].';

